    {
      "key": 3552,
      "source": "[i_PI_SabineFirehand]You must go to Lightfall Grove, Guardian!  I would go with you if I could, but with Madam Diana still out there, I must stay behind and do what I can should you and she fail...\r\n\r\nGo, Guardian!  And may the fury of the wild bring you victory!",
